{"id":10880,"date":"2024-01-11T17:05:21","date_gmt":"2024-01-12T01:05:21","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/?post_type=lesson&#038;p=10880"},"modified":"2024-08-13T19:53:27","modified_gmt":"2024-08-14T02:53:27","slug":"0-1-introduction-to-codrone-edu-jrotc","status":"publish","type":"lesson","link":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/lesson\/0-1-introduction-to-codrone-edu-jrotc\/","title":{"rendered":"0.1: Introduction to CoDrone EDU (JROTC ed.)"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"wpb-content-wrapper\"><p>[vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2213053f2f0\" name=\"6a2213053f2f0\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 1<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Welcome to CoDrone EDU (JROTC ed.)!<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_single_image image=&#8221;10932&#8243; img_size=&#8221;large&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][vc_column_text css_animation=&#8221;none&#8221;]Welcome to CoDrone EDU \u2013 the best solution to learn about drones and programming. CoDrone EDU is fully equipped with all the sensors and features you need to pilot and create dynamic autonomous programs. The possibilities of what you can build are endless! With CoDrone EDU, you will learn:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Drone piloting skills<\/li>\n<li>Critical thinking<\/li>\n<li>Programming skills (Blockly and Python)<\/li>\n<li>Autonomous programming with sensors<\/li>\n<li>Debugging skills<\/li>\n<li>Teamwork and communication skills<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Why JROTC edition?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][vc_single_image image=&#8221;10934&#8243; img_size=&#8221;large&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; style=&#8221;vc_box_circle_2&#8243;][vc_column_text]CoDrone EDU (JROTC ed.) is the same drone as CoDrone EDU, except it is made with special parts that meet national security standards and requirements. To distinguish the drone from CoDrone EDU, the JROTC edition has a white drone body and white Smart Controller. There are also some other minor changes that you will learn about in this Getting Started course. Don\u2019t worry \u2013 none of these changes affect the performance of the drone.[\/vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2213053f3ea\" name=\"6a2213053f3ea\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 2<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Watch the Introductory Video<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]The video below will introduce you to everything that comes with your CoDrone EDU, as well as resources that will help you get started.<br \/>\n<strong>Note: Although CoDrone EDU (JROTC ed.) may be a different color, all the information presented in this video still applies.<\/strong>[\/vc_column_text][vc_video link=&#8221;https:\/\/youtu.be\/5r5xsG97y-o&#8221; align=&#8221;center&#8221;]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2213053f497\" name=\"6a2213053f497\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 3<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>CoDrone EDU (JROTC ed.) Specifications and Features<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]<strong>Specifications:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Size: 138.5 x 138.5\u00a0 x\u00a0 34.8 mm<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Weight: 54.8 grams<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Battery: 3.7v 530mAh<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Continuous flight time: 7-8 minutes (on a complete charge)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Charge time: 60 minutes<\/span><\/li>\n<li>Payload capacity: &lt; 5 grams<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Maximum Velocity: 2.5 meters per second\u00a0 (9km\/h)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Communication Protocol: 2.4 GHz radio communication<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Range: 50 meters<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Sensors:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">3-axis gyroscope and accelerometer<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">barometer<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2 color sensors<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2 infrared range finders (front and bottom)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">optical flow (for position)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Features:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Auto-hovering and stabilization<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Programmable RGB LEDs on the drone and controller<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Programmable buzzer on the drone and controller<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2213053f50a\" name=\"6a2213053f50a\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 4<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>What's in the Box?<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]Here is what should be in your CoDrone EDU (JROTC ed.) box. Please check that you have all your pieces before you continue:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>User guide (available digitally <a href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/197x4EK-dSU0wOO6kPLRgyByDVkUHl-dr\/view?usp=sharing\">here<\/a>)<\/li>\n<li>CoDrone EDU (JROTC ed.)<\/li>\n<li>Smart Controller (JROTC ed.)<\/li>\n<li>3 x drone batteries<\/li>\n<li>1 x drone battery dual-charger<\/li>\n<li>1 x USB-C cable<\/li>\n<li>8 x color cards<\/li>\n<li>4 x extra propellers<\/li>\n<li>1 x propeller remover<\/li>\n<li>Screwdriver and spare bolts<\/li>\n<li>Set of labels for drone and controller<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][vc_single_image image=&#8221;10963&#8243; img_size=&#8221;full&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2213053f569\" name=\"6a2213053f569\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 5<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Review<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]Let&#8217;s review! You should have:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Watched the introductory video<\/li>\n<li>Read about the technical specifications, sensors, and features for CoDrone EDU (JROTC ed.)<\/li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Unboxed CoDrone EDU (JROTC ed.) and checked the parts list<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>In the next lesson, you will go through a pre-flight checklist to safely prepare for flight.[\/vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row]<\/p>\n<\/div>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"[vc_row][vc_column] Step 6 Welcome to CoDrone EDU (JROTC ed.)! [vc_single_image image=\"10932\" img_size=\"large\" alignment=\"center\"][vc_column_text css_animation=\"none\"]Welcome to CoDrone EDU \u2013 the best solution to learn about drones and programming. CoDrone EDU is&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/lesson\/0-1-introduction-to-codrone-edu-jrotc\/\">&hellip;<\/a>","protected":false},"featured_media":11244,"template":"","meta":{"_initial_content":"","_new_post":false,"_quiz_has_questions":false,"_lesson_complexity":"easy","_lesson_length":10,"_lesson_course":10878,"_lesson_preview":"preview"},"lesson-category":[],"lesson-tag":[14401,2174,2177,2109,10427],"class_list":["post-10880","lesson","type-lesson","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","lesson-tag-cdej","lesson-tag-coding","lesson-tag-getting-started","lesson-tag-introduction","lesson-tag-jrotc","module-getting-started","post","odd"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/lessons\/10880","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/lessons"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/lesson"}],"version-history":[{"count":30,"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/lessons\/10880\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":12484,"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/lessons\/10880\/revisions\/12484"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/11244"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=10880"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"lesson-category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/lesson-category?post=10880"},{"taxonomy":"lesson-tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/lesson-tag?post=10880"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}